entries[438607] = { ["name"] = "Meteor", ["text"] = "100 yd range\nInstant\nCalls down a meteor which lands at the target location after 3 sec, dealing (444% of Spell Power) Fire damage to all enemies, and burns the ground, dealing [8 * (8.53875% of Spell Power)] Fire damage over 8.5 sec to all enemies in the area.\n\nThe enemy closest to the center of the Meteor's impact takes 40% increased damage. Damage reduced beyond 8 targets." }
